		{
			"id": "eiMqhL-2lWIqnY7X2",
			"description": "Inferno Pistol",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A pistol-format melta weapon carried by Astartes command squads, Inquisitors and Tempestus officers wanting a point-blank answer to armour without a full meltagun's bulk; background consistently frames it as devastating at arm's length and near-useless at any real distance.\n\nDesign: Scaled down two dice from the meltagun anchor (8dx3(10) burn) to 6dx3(10) burn for a pistol- sized fuel cell, on a very short 5/25 range band matching the anchor's \"vehicle-killer at short range, much less beyond\" description. See the Meltagun entry for the armour check; a pistol still comfortably beats carapace and power armour at point-blank range even though it falls short of a full meltagun against the heaviest vehicle armour.",
