		{
			"id": "e64ziIFBU5EcDC7Nz",
			"description": "Multi-Melta",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A tripod- or vehicle-mounted heavy melta weapon fielded by heavy weapon teams and as a common tank sponson/hull weapon; background treats it exactly as a bigger meltagun, killing the heaviest vehicles at short range and rapidly losing effect beyond it.\n\nDesign: Two dice over the meltagun anchor (10d vs 8d), matching this project's standard heavy-weapon progression, on a slightly longer 15/75 range band appropriate to a crew-served weapon with a bigger reactor. ST 13 and Gunner (Beams) reflect a support weapon needing a mount or a very strong user rather than a shoulder-fired arm; the same short-range/beyond-½D split as the meltagun models the identical sharp fall-off.",
